{"verse_key": "14:22", "surah": 14, "verse": 22, "text_uthmani": "وَقَالَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ لَمَّا قُضِىَ ٱلْأَمْرُ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ وَعَدَكُمْ وَعْدَ ٱلْحَقِّ وَوَعَدتُّكُمْ فَأَخْلَفْتُكُمْ ۖ وَمَا كَانَ لِىَ عَلَيْكُم مِّن سُلْطَـٰنٍ إِلَّآ أَن دَعَوْتُكُمْ فَٱسْتَجَبْتُمْ لِى ۖ فَلَا تَلُومُونِى وَلُومُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَكُم ۖ مَّآ أَنَا۠ بِمُصْرِخِكُمْ وَمَآ أَنتُم بِمُصْرِخِىَّ ۖ إِنِّى كَفَرْتُ بِمَآ أَشْرَكْتُمُونِ مِن قَبْلُ ۗ إِنَّ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ", "translation": "And Satan will say when the matter has been concluded, \"Indeed, Allāh had promised you the promise of truth. And I promised you, but I betrayed you. But I had no authority over you except that I invited you, and you responded to me. So do not blame me; but blame yourselves. I cannot be called to your aid, nor can you be called to my aid. Indeed, I deny your association of me [with Allāh] before.<sup foot_note=196571>1</sup> Indeed, for the wrongdoers is a painful punishment.\"", "verse_from_ms": 534860, "verse_to_ms": 554950, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَقَالَ", "start_ms": 534860, "end_ms": 536120}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ", "start_ms": 536120, "end_ms": 537700}, {"i": 2, "text": "لَمَّا", "start_ms": 537700, "end_ms": 538690}, {"i": 3, "text": "قُضِىَ", "start_ms": 538690, "end_ms": 540350}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلْأَمْرُ", "start_ms": 540350, "end_ms": 541110}, {"i": 5, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 541110, "end_ms": 544180}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 544180, "end_ms": 544890}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَعَدَكُمْ", "start_ms": 544890, "end_ms": 546590}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَعْدَ", "start_ms": 546590, "end_ms": 547330}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 547330, "end_ms": 547730}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَوَعَدتُّكُمْ", "start_ms": 547730, "end_ms": 549910}, {"i": 11, "text": "فَأَخْلَفْتُكُمْ", "start_ms": 549910, "end_ms": 551240}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 551240, "end_ms